    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Literature",
      "links": [],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mark Brown: \"Damien\nHirst credits Blue Peter with idea for his controversial spin paintings.\nArtist says 'patent picture painter' demonstrated by John Noakes\non the show in 1975 inspired him as a child.\" The Guardian,\nWednesday 29 August, 2012.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hubert\nKlocker: \"Die ersten\nJahre. Wien, Paris 1956-1962.\" In: Alfons Schilling: Ich/Auge/Welt.\nThe Art of Vision. Springer, 1997.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Desmond\nMorris: The Biology of Art. London: Methuen & Co., 1962.",
      "links": []
    }
